version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-07
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/etemigarba/security-first-testing-playbook"
abstract: >-
  Runnable companion to the 56-slide course deck "Software Testing & Evaluation:
  A Security-First Playbook". Implements the deck's techniques as tested,
  dependency-free Python: property-based and mutation testing, authorisation
  matrix tests, risk-based vulnerability triage, SBOM/VEX/provenance
  verification, and an auditor that detects assertion-free tests.
keywords:
  - software testing
  - security testing
  - OWASP
  - NIST SSDF
  - supply chain
  - software engineering education
